definition.message:
{{#is_alert}}
**{{product.name}} is at Critical end-of-life risk** — EOL Risk Score {{value}}/100 (Critical is 76-100).

The score combines how long its release lines have been past end of life, its attack surface, CISA KEV exposure and whether extended support exists. Running an end-of-life release unpatched is a material security and compliance risk.

- View the score breakdown: https://endoflife.ai/{{product.name}}
- What to do: migrate to a supported release, or evaluate extended support.
{{/is_alert}}

{{#is_recovery}}
{{product.name}} EOL Risk Score has dropped below the Critical threshold.
{{/is_recovery}}

Methodology: https://endoflife.ai/risk-score
